      "start": 695,
      "end": 795,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20754621922969818
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "It is further submitted petitioner has been falsely implicated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 796,
      "end": 859,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23668567836284637
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Victim had voluntarily eloped with him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 860,
      "end": 899,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30560562014579773
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Accordingly, he prays for bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 900,
      "end": 932,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2598820626735687
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "2. Learned Advocate for the State opposes the prayer for bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 934,
      "end": 996,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "3. We have considered the materials on record including the evidence of the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 997,
      "end": 1081,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Victim is a minor.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1082,
      "end": 1100,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28508371114730835
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "She stated petitioner is a married person and she was confined in his house for a month and raped.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1101,
      "end": 1199,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32915377616882324
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Trial is in progress.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1200,
      "end": 1221,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21848030388355255
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Under such circumstances, we are not inclined to grant bail to the petitioner at this stage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1222,
      "end": 1314,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26977166533470154
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "4. The application for bail is thus rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1315,
      "end": 1361,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2118939757347107
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "5. Prosecution assures this court to conclude trial expeditiously.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
